      <guid>https://www.malte-grosser.com/home/about/</guid>
      <description>Hi, welcome to Almost Random!
Over the years, I’ve worked in both industry and research, spending quite a bit of time programming, exploring data, and seeing where an idea might lead.
Along the way, I’ve met a lot of interesting people working on similar topics. Every now and then, a neat idea for a side project came up, and some of those kept me busy for quite a while. You’ll find a selection of my projects here, along with talks I’ve given, publications from my research at UKE, and occasional blog posts.</description>
